{# Phase 4 / CFG-01 — CP Settings form. Replaces the Phase 1 placeholder.
   Decisions: D-62 (single page, H2-grouped sections — Connectivity / AI /
   Defaults / Verify / Adapters), D-63 (editableTable for array fields),
   D-64 (masked anthropicApiKey + env hint).
   Rendering contract: hasCpSettings = true + Plugin::settingsHtml() point
   at this template. Craft's settings/plugins/_settings.twig (cms vendor)
   already extends _layouts/cp, opens fullPageForm, injects
   actionInput/pluginHandle/redirectInput, then dumps `settingsHtml|raw`
   inside its own `{% block content %}`. This template is therefore an
   HTML FRAGMENT — no `{% extends %}`, no `{% block content %}` wrapper,
   no <form> or csrf/action inputs (would nest layouts and double-form).
#}
{% import "_includes/forms" as forms %}

